                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h2]Like the original Braveland but with a Weezord[/h2]\r\n\r\nFun turn based strategy game where you take turns and carry out actions n stuff. If you liked Braveland or any form of turn based strategy then this might be right up your alley. Did I mention I hate puns? No wait is that a pun? I hate English. Not the English, just English. Jeesh.\r\n\r\nThe art isn't bad for this style game but I did not get into this one as much as Braveland. I think I just got bored of the formula. If you enjoyed Braveland more than me, then by all means play Weezord too.\r\n\r\n[h2]7/10[/h2]\r\n\r\n[h3][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45905648-Gork%2527s-Game-Grind/]Check out my curated list of games[/url][/h3]",
                        "timestamp_created": 1786318036,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1786318036,
                        "voted_up": true,
                        "votes_up": 3,
